        "mobile_bottom": -26,
        "heading": "TikTok Ads for Aussie Brands",
        "sub_heading": "Where Attention Spans Are Short, But Impact Runs Deep",
        "text": "<p>TikTok isn’t just a trend—it’s a conversion machine. With over a billion monthly users and an algorithm that favours high-engagement content, TikTok Ads are perfect for brands that want to get in front of real people fast. Whether you're running an e-commerce store on Shopify or generating leads for a local service, this platform offers high-impact reach at a low cost.</p><p>If your ideal customer scrolls more than they search, you’re already late to the party. TikTok Ads let you tap into native-style video that blends right into the feed, builds trust, and drives action.</p><p>An Agency builds TikTok campaigns that are lean, punchy, and built for the Aussie market. From product showcases to lead gen hooks, we’ll help you stand out where the scroll never stops.</p>",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "button_text": "Speak To Our Team",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 60,
        "mobile_padding_top": 40,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
