        "heading": "Why TikTok Ads Are a Smart Move",
        "sub_heading": "How An Agency Helps You Stand Out Online",
        "text": "<p>TikTok’s user base is growing older and spending more—and that’s your window. A well-built campaign on TikTok isn’t about trends, it’s about strategy. We help you show up with the right message, for the right audience, at the right time.</p><p>E-commerce brands can demonstrate product value in seconds with visual hooks that stick. Tradies and service providers can position themselves as local legends with simple, effective storytelling.</p><p>From scriptwriting and creative to campaign setup and optimisation, we handle the heavy lifting. You get the clicks, calls, and conversions.</p>",
        "button_link": "#",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 60,
        "mobile_padding_top": 40,
