        "mobile_top": -25,
        "mobile_right": 0,
        "mobile_bottom": -1,
        "heading": "We Help You Go Viral for the Right Reasons",
        "sub_heading": "Standout TikTok Ads for Trades and Ecomm Brands",
        "text": "<p>Most people scroll TikTok for fun — we turn that scroll into a sale, lead or booking. Whether you're selling products on Shopify or offering local services, TikTok Ads give you a chance to cut through fast with creative that sticks. Short-form video works when it’s built around strategy, not guesswork.</p><p>We don’t do cookie-cutter. We create thumb-stopping campaigns tailored to your business goals — from brand awareness to direct conversions. Our creatives get people to stop, watch, and act.</p><p>If your audience is under 45, chances are they’re already on TikTok. So the real question is — are you?</p>",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": true,
