          "settings": {
            "heading": "AUSSIE THROUGH AND THROUGH",
            "main_text": "<p>We’re based here, we get the local market, and we know what Aussies actually engage with online. No offshore fluff — just clear, conversion-focused results for real businesses.</p><p></p>",
