      "settings": {
        "heading": "An Agency: A TikTok Ads Partner You Can Count On",
        "text": "<p>You’ve probably been told to “get on TikTok” — and sure, the platform is exploding. But it’s not about jumping on every trend. It’s about showing up with purpose, building trust, and delivering ads that actually lead to real enquiries, not just views.</p><p>That’s what we do at An Agency. We’re not here to sell you hype. We build campaigns for tradies and Shopify brands that know who they are, what they offer, and who they want to reach. Whether you're a local service business or a fast-moving product store, we’ll help you show up, stand out, and grow your business the smart way.</p>",
        "trust_image": "shopify://shop_images/Artboard_13.png",
        "desktop_padding_top": 60,
        "desktop_padding_bottom": 60,
        "mobile_padding_top": 40,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 40
      }
