        "mobile_bottom": -30,
        "heading": "Digital Campaigns That Don’t Just Look Good — They Work",
        "sub_heading": "How An Agency Helps You Win on TikTok",
        "text": "<p>Running TikTok Ads isn’t just about putting up a video and hoping for views. Our team builds campaigns that are backed by data, optimised for your audience, and crafted to convert.</p><p>We work with both Shopify businesses and tradies to create high-performing ads that match what your audience actually wants to see. From creative hooks to compelling CTAs, we do it all in-house — and we test until it clicks.</p><p>Whether it’s a 15-second punchy promo or a 60-second walkthrough, we help you create content that gets attention and drives results.</p><h3></h3>",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "button_text": "Help Grow My Business",
        "image_right": false,
        "text_align": "left",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
