        "mobile_left": -1,
        "mobile_top": -1,
        "mobile_right": -1,
        "mobile_bottom": -1,
        "heading": "Strategic Ads, Real Results",
        "sub_heading": "More Eyes. More Clicks. More Customers.",
        "text": "<p>Let’s talk numbers. TikTok has over 8 million users in Australia alone — and it’s still growing. If you're not running ads here, you're leaving serious money on the table.</p><p>For eCommerce, TikTok drives impulse buys and repeat traffic. For tradies, it builds trust and authority fast. We tailor each campaign based on your niche, audience behaviour, and what gets results in your space.</p><p>You don’t need to be a dancing plumber or a trend-savvy fashion label to win on TikTok — you just need the right strategy.</p>",
