        "heading": "The Challenge of Marketing for Tradies",
        "sub_heading": "You’re up against a crowded market, and let’s be real—your expertise is in your trade, not marketing.",
        "text": "<p><strong>If you’re not using the right strategies, your ideal clients won’t find you. In today’s digital world, being good at what you do isn’t enough—you need to be seen.</strong></p><p>That’s where we come in. An Agency has years of experience helping Aussie tradies grow their businesses. We know what works, what doesn’t, and how to get real results—so you can focus on the job while we handle the marketing.</p>",
